<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.196 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.196 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   100.359/ 6.196 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    100.00 to 100.40</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price 100.35</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     82.003</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  14.040 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   23.605 billion francs</p>
<p>* 5.00 pct, March 2001 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   100.765 / 4.796 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    100.45 to 100.80</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price 100.75</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     73.273</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  14.025 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   24.620 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
